sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Redis
  participant GW as Realtime gateway
  participant Tab as Staff browser tab
  Owner->>Web: Roles and permissions, Save changes
  Web->>API: PATCH /admin/roles/:id
  API->>PG: update employment_roles, commit
  API->>PG: access_version plus 1 after commit
  API->>Redis: publish access changed with organization and version
  Redis-->>API: every API and worker process drops its cached contexts
  API->>GW: emit access.changed to room org:id
  GW-->>Tab: access.changed with the new version
  Tab->>API: GET /me/access
  API->>PG: read access_version, resolve a fresh context
  API-->>Tab: new permissions, features, navigation, home page
  Tab->>Tab: sidebar and buttons re-render
  Note over Tab,API: Socket down - refetch on window focus after 30 s<br/>Backend enforces the new version within 15 s
